{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>A stranger and a settler am I with you.</b> A stranger from another land, and I have settled with you. And its midrash — if you wish, I am a stranger; and if not, I will be a settler and take it by law, for the Holy One, blessed be He, said to me, 'To your seed I will give this land.'" "<b>A burial-holding.</b> A holding of land for a burial-house."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:00.910129885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}